                                "sense_id": "e0718aeb-d587-3e98-8d23-93b9fd4b1e07",
                                "text": "Some drugs produce vivid hallucinations, others induce a relaxed condition, or are ataractic in their effect, that is, promote temporary tranquility[.]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cea06a4a-8fdd-4cae-a1d0-f22177de3b81",
                                "sense_id": "e0718aeb-d587-3e98-8d23-93b9fd4b1e07",
                                "text": "Later on he was treated by the same psychiatrist with ataractic drugs."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
